      "title": "The Duties of Man, Chapter I: Introduction (1844)",
      "author": "Giuseppe Mazzini",
      "url": "https://history.hanover.edu/texts/Mazzini/mazzini1.html",
      "usedFor": "Duties before rights; duty to humanity and country; education rather than violence as method"
